      {
        "name": "advance_case",
        "doc": " LF-006b: permissionless, deterministic advance into the agreed dispute\n procedure (`docs/06`, FD-07, OQ-07). **Any caller.** SUBMITTED after\n review end → DISPUTED NO_RESPONSE (T0 = submitted_at + review); FUNDED\n after delivery + grace → DISPUTED NON_DELIVERY (T0 = delivery + grace).\n The result depends only on stored state and chain time; funds,\n allocation, withdrawals and E are unchanged. No settlement here.",
        "kind": "call",
        "params": {
          "serialization_type": "json",
          "args": [
            {
              "name": "agreement_id",
              "type_schema": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "line_id",
              "type_schema": {
