          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "outstanding_liabilities",
        "doc": " Rule B: outstanding customer token liabilities E (locked + claimable +\n pending over all lines; paid excluded). Read-only observation: compare\n with the token's `ft_balance_of(escrow)` offchain. A surplus (balance >\n E) comes from inflows not credited as funding, which are never credited\n or swept. The aggregate balance is never used to infer or change any\n withdrawal outcome (`docs/27` R-2).",
        "kind": "view",
        "result": {
          "serialization_type": "json",
          "type_schema": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "propose_split",
        "doc": " LF-007: the buyer or supplier proposes a split of a DISPUTED line,\n `buyer_amount + supplier_amount == principal` (canonical decimal\n strings, checked). Becomes the line's single active proposal and\n supersedes any earlier one. Allowed in every dispute phase until a\n final allocation exists (`docs/08`). No ledger move, no token call.\n Returns the new proposal id (per-line nonce).",
        "kind": "call",
        "params": {
          "serialization_type": "json",
          "args": [
            {
              "name": "agreement_id",
              "type_schema": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "line_id",
              "type_schema": {
                "type": "integer",
                "format": "uint32",
                "minimum": 0.0
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "buyer_amount",
              "type_schema": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "supplier_amount",
              "type_schema": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "result": {
          "serialization_type": "json",
          "type_schema": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "submit_delivery",
        "doc": " LF-006: the supplier commits delivery evidence for a FUNDED line before\n `delivery_deadline + grace`. `evidence_commitment` is 64 lowercase hex\n characters (a salted commitment, never raw content; `docs/09`).",
        "kind": "call",
        "params": {
          "serialization_type": "json",
          "args": [
            {
              "name": "agreement_id",
              "type_schema": {
